WEBVTT

00:16:59.621 --> 00:17:01.978
and this is the best-designed
toilet in the world.

00:17:02.002 --> 00:17:05.049
If you're ever, ever in India,
go use this toilet.

00:17:05.073 --> 00:17:06.143
(Laughter)

00:17:06.167 --> 00:17:08.135
Chris Luebkeman will tell you why.

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:11.152
I'm sure that's how he wanted
to spend the party.

00:17:16.548 --> 00:17:19.858
But the future is not going to be
the sky-scraping cities of New York,

00:17:19.882 --> 00:17:21.033
but this.

00:17:21.057 --> 00:17:23.143
And when you look at this, you see crisis.

00:17:23.167 --> 00:17:25.834
What I see is many, many inventors.

00:17:26.469 --> 00:17:28.604
One billion people live in abject poverty.

00:17:28.628 --> 00:17:30.272
We hear about them all the time.